id:                     E3507
trigger_tool: python|test|runtime
phase: testing|runtime
error_signature: ModuleNotFoundError: No module named .pkg_resources.
severity:               3
category:               compat, detection, portability, testing
match_keywords: pkg_resources, iter_entry_points, importlib.metadata, entry_points, dist-info, LOAD_METADATA_PLUGINS, LOAD_FORMATTER_PLUGINS
title: 废弃入口点 API 迁移必须用真实插件元数据验证分组和关闭开关
root_cause: Legacy plugin registry imports pkg_resources although packaging metadata omits the runtime dependency; plain top-level import can pass without exercising lazy registry discovery. Replacing discovery with an empty result hides the import error but disables plugins.
affected_scope: Python 3.8+ plugin registries using iter_entry_points group/name/load without legacy dependency activation or resource extraction semantics
verification_cmd: ISBNLIB_PACKAGE_ROOT=<installed-site> python3 -I -S archives/i/isbnlib/3.10.14/test_package/test_isbnlib.py
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: migrate-entry-point-discovery-with-real-dist-info-regression
rec_description: Use importlib.metadata.entry_points; select(group=...) on selectable results or mapping.get(group, ()) on Python 3.8/3.9. Preserve name/load and configuration gates. In a fresh isolated interpreter install real METADATA and entry_points.txt fixtures, execute discovered callables and verify unrelated groups/disabled plugins stay absent.
rec_command: python3 -I -S test_isbnlib.py InstalledIsbnlibTests.test_11_plugin_groups InstalledIsbnlibTests.test_12_plugins_disabled InstalledIsbnlibTests.test_13_no_plugins
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl:
forbid_1_pattern: def iter_entry_points.*return.*\[\]
forbid_1_reason: Returning no plugins only conceals the missing import and drops user functionality
forbid_1_consequence: Basic import passes while installed plugins disappear
forbid_2_pattern: pip install.*setuptools
forbid_2_reason: Ambient tool installation is not a declared portable runtime closure
forbid_2_consequence: Clean consumer still fails; no Conan publication evidence
principles:
doc_file: drafts/E429-draft-ISBN.md
last_updated: 2026-10-16
source_event: isbnlib 3.10.14 on HarmonyOS PC; isolated registry failure, true dist-info plugin regression and installed-consumer validation
authors: chenicia <2301_79503900@noreply.gitcode.com>
source_pr:
source_commit:
metrics_success_count: 1
metrics_fail_count: 0
metrics_confidence: 1.0
metrics_last_used: 2026-10-16
rec_impl:               manual
